a48cd1a1e533cc1079a4"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/git/commits/351121c5c590c9731aed49b982dab7c58e994ffb", "verification": {"payload": "tree fc9cf8a62d9a297269c3a48cd1a1e533cc1079a4\nparent 64bcc8db2f82a3ceca2de38c210124e499afd874\nauthor Shunsuke Shibayama <45118249+mtshiba@users.noreply.github.com> 1754364728 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1754364728 -0700\n\n[ty] fix incorrect lazy scope narrowing (#19744)\n\n## Summary\n\nThis is a follow-up to #19321.\n\nNarrowing constraints introduced in a class scope were not applied even\nwhen they can be applied in lazy nested scopes. This PR fixes so that\nthey are now applied.\nConversely, there were cases where narrowing constraints were being\napplied in places where they should not, so it is also fixed.\n\n## Test Plan\n\nSome TODOs in `narrow/conditionals/nested.md` are now work correctly.", "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJokXs4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAM9cQABa6jraSKX5yiHqX4fKqdj5/\nflWe1lQCzo1usJVCioLW6AeTw9G60LZQx+fplQ2tYza8CMwygsL+sT/+/PA+y88M\nlwWyu7NrzNBE+q59lTCCI92xrEsFq3oXR87xkT5mwO5immJnG/MGasN3/ppBs4lh\nj5VA96V7fOqs5A7alh4SFZ15JVznPelGUntKZNWqEm+F9Uthzsu+zTTBAWMsVRdL\n9VuVr+nvwosD8bxQG1STeTAuH0ok/1O/+USkyZoUXiShuADgOT0NYLSmnVqD9cqz\nrKaO7i925um3pqyyBqXZhWwtnwGasMn1syVAdK6417hLOadqCBuvOjQqupPkYCWb\noMO7lvoFnz8N6rzoNGURNU3byayK/kBkKlc7KYRnyzWVHEyW4Nw0QQXPuJgV/b9o\nFGBWbNqmtvGYxZesz2yWEjDFg9oc+2ClKrENG6rske/FrS6h8BuyVRc3b4s11+0n\nQL5RZUjSUJENUNRn/D6CTMa11CyGdYx0BKmp00sAxFLIjopCXMcjhKsFu57F5FeV\norm7wyFmTGyApoiqnSbw+pMV/wwXb9EzWC2qw7L214sxAU+2BU+3l+MO8MnV+e5Y\n+gp9r4zt8J9/GYuHO9OpFBZbYhHVmy1LAMKSWmr8XDCcZQxT0pARENsj8v/uSG+x\nSkWMcmAHZoSELmND4PK+\n=bSs4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "verified": true, "verified_at": "2025-08-05T03:32:09Z"}}, "committer": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/