: 0, "committer": {"date": "2025-06-17T09:07:46Z", "email": "noreply@github.com", "name": "GitHub"}, "message": "[ty] basic narrowing on attribute and subscript expressions (#17643)\n\n## Summary\n\nThis PR closes astral-sh/ty#164.\n\nThis PR introduces a basic type narrowing mechanism for\nattribute/subscript expressions.\nMember accesses, int literal subscripts, string literal subscripts are\nsupported (same as mypy and pyright).\n\n## Test Plan\n\nNew test cases are added to `mdtest/narrow/complex_target.md`.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: David Peter <mail@david-peter.de>", "tree": {"sha": "eefd92f637bca0c12d7adfdf84a58dfd15223c76", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/git/trees/eefd92f637bca0c12d7adfdf84a58dfd15223c76"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/git/commits/342b2665db8a540d6410a6c13a94cc78742a1152", "verification": {"payload": "tree eefd92f637bca0c12d7adfdf84a58dfd15223c76\nparent 390918e7901f81556d659c687a83188e7ad91cfa\nauthor Shunsuke Shibayama <45118249+mtshiba@users.noreply.github.com> 1750151266 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1750151266 +0200\n\n[ty] basic narrowing on attribute and subscript expressions (#17643)\n\n## Summary\n\nThis PR closes astral-sh/ty#164.\n\nThis PR introduces a basic type narrowing mechanism for\nattribute/subscript expressions.\nMember accesses, int literal subscripts, string literal subscripts are\nsupported (same as mypy and pyright).\n\n## Test Plan\n\nNew test cases are added to `mdtest/narrow/complex_target.md`.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: David Peter <mail@david-peter.de>", "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoUTBiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1uwQABhiBjhOUamuSnWVox2doypn\n9wuVMMPX/MBF6j4RUGMecEXXhDyhKaERywThphbkE4HcgEXUTmheRMG7jNq9GXTM\nc9HETp86y0XR7NinK9h+muc6ycbJjD8NNqUF16MDOh0y/Hc7ENZPV5InJakSRrIv\nMiWnxKjgQmqPRxTXgAUGzj7kw9wGzvaXtDzS8kEnIHBLWatumQe6N5lUf73zD/ZB\n2iCGKdhROf+H1qbYGqI1XZYubixC4Tmftm1SiBCgzVoqY5BupgYILQBJKP1N92uI\ng