rl": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/commits/342b2665db8a540d6410a6c13a94cc78742a1152"}, {"author": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45118249?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mtshiba/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mtshiba/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mtshiba/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mtshiba/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/mtshiba", "id": 45118249, "login": "mtshiba", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTE4MjQ5", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mtshiba/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mtshiba/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mtshiba/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mtshiba/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mtshiba/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/mtshiba", "user_view_type": "public"}, "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/commits/0858896bc434bb7666b7230bde52d2113f328ac9/comments", "commit": {"author": {"date": "2025-06-05T00:24:27Z", "email": "45118249+mtshiba@users.noreply.github.com", "name": "Shunsuke Shibayama"}, "comment_count": 0, "committer": {"date": "2025-06-05T00:24:27Z", "email": "noreply@github.com", "name": "GitHub"}, "message": "[ty] type narrowing by attribute/subscript assignments (#18041)\n\n## Summary\n\nThis PR partially solves https://github.com/astral-sh/ty/issues/164\n(derived from #17643).\n\nCurrently, the definitions we manage are limited to those for simple\nname (symbol) targets, but we expand this to track definitions for\nattribute and subscript targets as well.\n\nThis was originally planned as part of the work in #17643, but the\nchanges are significant, so I made it a separate PR.\nAfter merging this PR, I will reflect this changes in #17643.\n\nThere is still some incomplete work remaining, but the basic features\nhave been implemented, so I am publishing it as a draft PR.\nHere is the TODO list (there may be more to come):\n* [x] Complete rewrite and refactoring of documentation (removing\n`Symbol` and replacing it with `Place`)\n* [x] More thorough testing\n* [x] Consolidation of duplicated code (maybe we can consolidate the\nhandling related to name, attribute, and subscript)\n\nThis PR replaces the current `Symbol` API with the `Place` API, which is\na concept that includes attributes and subscripts (the term is borrowed\nfrom Rust).\n\n## Test Plan\n\n`mdtest/narrow/assignment.md` is added.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: David Peter <sharkdp@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Carl Meyer <carl@astral.sh>", "tree": {"sha": "efae474a442769f7f17439796d6f921fd2568bb9", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/git/trees/efae474a442769f7f17439796d6f921fd2568bb9"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/git/commits/0858896bc434bb7666b7230bde52d2113f328ac9", "verification": {"payload": "tree efae474a442769f7f17439796d6f921fd2568bb9\nparent ce8b744f17ef2bfe0a507a197df947458703d42e\nauthor Shunsuke Shibayama <45118249+mtshiba@users.noreply.github.com> 1749083067 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1749083067 -0700\n\n[ty] type narrowing by attribute/subscript assignments (#18041)\n\n## Summary\n\nThis PR partially solves https://github.com/astral-sh/ty/issues/164\n(derived from #17643).\n\nCurrently, the definitions we manage are limited to those for simple\nname (symbol) targets, but we expand this to track definitions for\nattribute and subscript targets as well.\n\nThis was originally planned as part of the work in #17643, but the\nchanges are significant, so I made it a separate PR.\nAfter merging this PR, I will reflect this changes in #17643.\n\nThere is still some incomplete work remaining, but the basic features\nhave been implemented, so I am publishing it as a draft PR.\nHere is the TODO list (there may be more to come):\n* [x] Complete rewrite and refactoring of documentation (removing\n`Symbol` and replacing it with `Place`)\n* [x] More thorough testing\n* [x] Consolidation of duplicated code (maybe we can consolidate the\nhandling related to name, attribute, and subscript)\n\nThis PR replaces the current `Symbol` API with the `Place` API, which is\na concept that includes attributes and subscripts (the term is borrowed\nfrom Rust).\n\n## Test Plan\n\n`mdtest/narrow/assignment.md` is added.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: David Peter <sharkdp@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Carl Meyer <carl@astral.sh>", "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoQOO7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPV4QAGfwrWbRfgyloyIhuYUqFPD+\njmFMuGUyfxrbwJdtRZ7/PdPk6UJ5VYRh6BQteVh3SoDMazmJeIM7VvtFSuMZdF6O\nEOo/A7yf21qj23EkXoe5L1XR0eej+2KtOpacEvg8T+qQTOjNh7UYKuMHB8uTmOrT\napDxISZ/+SafS1PTiu6Okl7JFIOULnyW6aJHVI3q/BeEv1I4kWxiTE7wlFDfAnkJ\na/jiaM09Y3K4V+eKVcqSlAD+VAqjZ2vRbHIUlOlW1w2U7A/fnZ0ufT8NiWxf9wUU\nJ1b5IoEfcItUOrdAhFBUfktZamM8JNIhI2/dMWX49JAVcO2uQD5G2Oolg/79jb3U\nEZDA1YGACMUtwOp4NQW/eYM+oWN8j1evsANvcjfyWyH5hu6CYvF4NSQU3YunNnQv\nMs4vYRkyngYg73HRtOJeYj4PPM6x0NxI1xt1h8G4iuSTYxLD7SpkFcRp5IyROT51\n/EpguuWujt8aYqQbCYQ2mtBhOKiyUiTGGv8CN1UftgkesbIMIzLmd24Ws4GgD44L\n5aro/F/lEndI7HxLJ9UN9LDXhz87n+pkG7PvMgSfuxdRZjL30IB4+L9gzwExZY+y\nDCmAzUztJqmnWVK+lUA5bVWG799nQf3760es/yX0aUIW0x0OInjovrRALjJpknGX\nIyvsyEB9yxjfLwdA0GV1\n=qHv5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "verified": true, "verified_at": "2025-06-05T00:24:29Z"}}, "committer": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https: